<title>USA: Magna Bancorp Inc Q2 Dec 31 net rises.</title>
<headline>Magna Bancorp Inc Q2 Dec 31 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>HATTIESBURG, Miss 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.40		    $0.37</p>
<p> Net			  5,590		    5,203</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  13,881		   14,112</p>
<p>	  6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.53		    $0.77</p>
<p> Net			  7,342		   10,919</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  13,879		   14,123</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTES: Six month 1996 earnings include recognition of a $5.9 million pre-tax expense for a special one-time assessment to recapitalize the Savings Association Insurance Fund. Net earnings for the period excluding the expense were $0.79 per share.</p>
<p>Net interest income for 1996 Q2 was $16.6 million, compared with $16.2 million in 1995 period.</p>
</text>
